{"title":"New York State Math League","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>New York State Math League</b> (NYSML) is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_competition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math competition\">math competition</a> for teams from around New York state.  It is held every spring at a different site around the state; the 2007 contest was held in New York City and the 2008 contest was hosted by the Monroe County Mathematics League on April 5.  The contest has been held every year since 1973.\n</p><p>The format of NYSML is identical to that of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ARML\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ARML\">ARML</a>, with 15-member teams competing in Individual, Team, Relay, and Power rounds, although the scoring is slightly different.  Teams compete in A and B divisions (just as at ARML).  \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Results\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Results</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#2006_(Nyack_High_School,_Rockland)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2006 (Nyack High School, Rockland)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#2007_(Stuyvesant_High_School,_New_York)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2007 (Stuyvesant High School, New York)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#2008_(Victor_Senior_High_School,_Victor)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2008 (Victor Senior High School, Victor)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#2014_(Fayetteville-Manlius_High_School,_Manlius)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2014 (Fayetteville-Manlius High School, Manlius)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Results\">Results</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_State_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Results\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"2006_.28Nyack_High_School.2C_Rockland.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2006_(Nyack_High_School,_Rockland)\">2006 (Nyack High School, Rockland)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_State_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: 2006 (Nyack High School, Rockland)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Division A: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_City_ARML\" title=\"New York City ARML\">New York City A</a></li>\n<li>Division B: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Albany_Area_Math_Circle\" title=\"Albany Area Math Circle\">Albany Area Math Circle</a></li>\n<li>Most Improved: DUSO B (Dutchess/Ulster/Sullivan/Orange counties)</li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"2007_.28Stuyvesant_High_School.2C_New_York.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2007_(Stuyvesant_High_School,_New_York)\">2007 (Stuyvesant High School, New York)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_State_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: 2007 (Stuyvesant High School, New York)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Division A: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_City_ARML\" title=\"New York City ARML\">New York City A</a></li>\n<li>Division B: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Monroe_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Monroe ARML (page does not exist)\"> Monroe A</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"2008_.28Victor_Senior_High_School.2C_Victor.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2008_(Victor_Senior_High_School,_Victor)\">2008 (Victor Senior High School, Victor)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_State_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: 2008 (Victor Senior High School, Victor)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Division A: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_City_ARML\" title=\"New York City ARML\">New York City A</a></li>\n<li>Division B: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=DUSO_A&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"DUSO A (page does not exist)\">DUSO A</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"2014_.28Fayetteville-Manlius_High_School.2C_Manlius.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2014_(Fayetteville-Manlius_High_School,_Manlius)\">2014 (Fayetteville-Manlius High School, Manlius)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_State_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: 2014 (Fayetteville-Manlius High School, Manlius)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Division A: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_City_ARML\" title=\"New York City ARML\">New York City (Senior team)</a></li>\n<li>Division B: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Suffolk_A&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Suffolk A (page does not exist)\">Suffolk A</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_State_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://nysml.com/\">NYSML homepage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"New York mathematics competitions\">New York mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_State_Math_League&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017201542\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 34/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 319/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.704      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.704      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3408:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017201542 and revision id 194779. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}